==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*4 [[Selena]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Selena]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
Selenas can be taken out by units with midrange or higher. Once all Selenas have been taken out, Kurosawah can finally be safely put down.

